you became my Sister.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A fifth-year student, which is the highest year at Ieva Girls' School. He is Erena's roommate in the dormitory. He is the school's Madonna, who combines both glamour and beauty, and is also the top star of the Yokohama Revue. He gets into a sisterhood relationship, called \"Esu,\" with Erena."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the head of the Koshadou family, an Onmyoji family that has existed since the Heian period (794-1185). He is in pursuit of a demon that needs to be subdued."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63538"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23ad6f682780ae1517da1502611d3077f3426b46966ecd56a3f377fdf1994720.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/8317c11f835022a55a38b73d34ed581509c87a06fb25ecc495f6d13a96029619.webp","width":200,"height":200,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"村瀬 歩","creatorId":"vndb:s86","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s86","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s86","name":"村瀬 歩","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70753","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63540","characterName":"神藤 将成","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63540"},"originalCharacterName":"神藤 将成","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I will not allow you to secrecy. Answer all that is asked.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the second son of the Shindou family, which is a noble family. After graduating from the Yokohama Naval Academy at the top of his clas