ate to those around him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sometimes he calls \"Shindou-shoui\" by just \"Shindou\" because of his school habit."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63545"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c2f92112b46c0920ad38f23f897615b9d31c58bb258d33602bdaa868278dd870.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c0977e535104d95f46c1f14a2f6e4b5a411fd10b1277a4492a6a3fd6c5d9531.webp","width":200,"height":200,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浜添 伸也","creatorId":"vndb:s14683","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14683","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14683","name":"浜添 伸也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70760","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63546","characterName":"周防 静","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63546"},"originalCharacterName":"周防 静","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"30"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Recently, Iori-sama’s atmosphere has changed somewhat.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Minamoto Iori's secretary."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is intelligent and has a handsome face, a gentle demeanor, and is always smiling."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63546"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70e3224ae3bf49e6dbc166eb3d5204e8ae66db54dd43551e3431d5b6f4d2aa5a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters